cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VSF or reference the study in academic work, please cite the paper below."
title: "VSF - Variable Swapping Framework"
abstract: "Research artifact for the IEEE S&P 2025 paper '403 Forbidden? Ethically Evaluating Broken Access Control in the Wild'. VSF is a differential testing framework that detects broken access control on live websites without exposing uninvolved users' data."
type: software
